<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <meta name="description" content="Une carte gratuite pour les randonneurs issue des données OpenHikingMap.">
    <title>Légende de la carte OpenHikingMap</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            color: #333;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin: 20px;
            background-color: #f9f9f9;
        }

        header h1 {
            color: #00386b;
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .legend-section {
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            background-color: #fff;
            padding: 15px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }

        .legend-title {
            font-size: 1.2em;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-top: 15px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            display: block;
            color: #005691;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #eee;
            padding-bottom: 5px;
        }
        
        .legend-list {
            list-style: none;
            padding: 0;
            margin: 0;
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            font-size: 0.9em;
        }

        .legend-item {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            width: 30%;
            min-width: 180px;
            padding: 5px 10px 5px 0;
        }

        .legend-item img {
            margin-right: 8px;
            height: 20px;
            object-fit: contain;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }

        .line-and-path-img img {
            height: auto;
            max-height: 20px;
            width: auto; 
        }

        .roads-paths-list {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 10px 20px;
            list-style: none;
            padding: 0;
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 0.9em;
        }

        .roads-paths-item {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 5px 0;
        }
        
        .roads-paths-item img {
            margin-right: 8px;
            height: auto;
            max-height: 20px;
            width: auto;
            object-fit: contain;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }

        hr {
            border: none;
            border-top: 1px solid #eee;
            margin: 30px 0;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <h1>Légende de la carte OpenHikingMap</h1>
    </header>

    <div class="legend-section">
        <span class="legend-title">Randonnée & Sentiers (Classification de difficulté échelle SAC)</span>
        
        <ul class="legend-list">
            <li class="legend-item">
                <svg width="40" height="20"><line x1="5" y1="10" x2="35" y2="10" stroke="#f12b2b" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
                T1 / T2 / Difficulté inconnue
            </li>
            <li class="legend-item">
                <svg width="40" height="20"><line x1="5" y1="10" x2="35" y2="10" stroke="#f12b2b" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-dasharray="7,5"/></svg>
                T3 / T4
            </li>
            <li class="legend-item">
                <svg width="40" height="20"><line x1="5" y1="10" x2="35" y2="10" stroke="#f12b2b" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-dasharray="1,6"/></svg>
                T5 / T6
            </li>
            <li class="legend-item">
                <svg width="40" height="20">
                    <line x1="5" y1="10" x2="35" y2="10" stroke="#f12b2b" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"/>
                    <text x="20" y="14" font-family="Arial" font-size="13" fill="#f12b2b" font-weight="bold" stroke="white" stroke-width="0.3" paint-order="stroke" text-anchor="middle">✕</text>
                </svg>
                Accès interdit
            </li>
        </ul>

        <div style="font-size: 0.85em; color: #666; margin: 10px 0 5px 0; font-style: italic; border-top: 1px dashed #eee; padding-top: 5px;">
            Sentiers avec une faible visibilité au sol :
        </div>
        <ul class="legend-list">
            <li class="legend-item">
                <svg width="40" height="20"><line x1="5" y1="10" x2="35" y2="10" stroke="#f12b2b" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-opacity="0.5"/></svg>
                T1 / T2 / Difficulté inconnue
            </li>
            <li class="legend-item">
                <svg width="40" height="20"><line x1="5" y1="10" x2="35" y2="10" stroke="#f12b2b" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-dasharray="7,5" stroke-opacity="0.5"/></svg>
                T3 / T4
            </li>
            <li class="legend-item">
                <svg width="40" height="20"><line x1="5" y1="10" x2="35" y2="10" stroke="#f12b2b" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-dasharray="1,6" stroke-opacity="0.5"/></svg>
                T5 / T6
            </li>
        </ul>

        <div style="margin-top: 10px;">
            <ul class="legend-list">
                <li>
                    <img src="./legend-images/via_ferrata.png" alt="Via Ferrata">
                    Via Ferrata
                </li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="legend-section">
        <span class="legend-title">Pistes (pour véhicules)</span>
        <div style="font-size: 0.85em; color: #666; margin: 0 0 10px 0; font-style: italic;">
            Praticable avec les véhicules suivants :
        </div>
        <ul class="roads-paths-list">
            <li class="roads-paths-item">
                <svg width="40" height="20" viewBox="0 0 40 20" style="margin-right: 5px;">
                    <line x1="0" y1="10" x2="40" y2="10" stroke="black" stroke-width="4.6" />
                    <line x1="0" y1="10" x2="40" y2="10" stroke="white" stroke-width="2.8" />
                </svg>
                Piste goudronnée (tous véhicules)
            </li>

            <li class="roads-paths-item">
                <svg width="40" height="20" viewBox="0 0 40 20" style="margin-right: 15px;">
                    <line x1="0" y1="8.2" x2="40" y2="8.2" stroke="#8B4513" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-opacity="0.65" />
                    <line x1="0" y1="11.8" x2="40" y2="11.8" stroke="#8B4513" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-opacity="0.65" />
                </svg>
                Voitures normales et vélos de ville
            </li>

            <li class="roads-paths-item">
                <svg width="40" height="20" viewBox="0 0 40 20" style="margin-right: 5px;">
                    <line x1="0" y1="8.2" x2="40" y2="8.2" stroke="#8B4513" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-opacity="0.65" />
                    <line x1="0" y1="11.8" x2="40" y2="11.8" stroke="#8B4513" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-dasharray="6,4" stroke-opacity="0.65" />
                </svg>
                Voitures surélevées (SUV) et rapports courts
            </li>

            <li class="roads-paths-item">
                <svg width="40" height="20" viewBox="0 0 40 20" style="margin-right: 5px;">
                    <line x1="0" y1="8.2" x2="40" y2="8.2" stroke="#8B4513" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-dasharray="4,4" stroke-opacity="0.65" />
                    <line x1="0" y1="11.8" x2="40" y2="11.8" stroke="#8B4513" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-dasharray="4,4" stroke-opacity="0.65" />
                </svg>
                Véhicules tout-terrain lourds (4x4)
            </li>

            <li class="roads-paths-item">
                <svg width="40" height="20" viewBox="0 0 40 20" style="margin-right: 5px;">
                    <line x1="0" y1="8.2" x2="40" y2="8.2" stroke="#8B4513" stroke-width="1.1" stroke-dasharray="5,5" stroke-opacity="0.65" />
                    <line x1="0" y1="11.8" x2="40" y2="11.8" stroke="#8B4513" stroke-width="1.1" stroke-dasharray="5,5" stroke-opacity="0.65" />
                    <text x="20" y="14" font-family="Arial" font-size="11" fill="#8B4513" font-weight="bold" stroke="white" stroke-width="0.3" paint-order="stroke" text-anchor="middle">?</text>
                </svg>
                Inconnu
            </li>
            <li class="roads-paths-item">
                <svg width="40" height="20" viewBox="0 0 40 20" style="margin-right: 5px;">
                    <line x1="0" y1="8.2" x2="40" y2="8.2" stroke="#8B4513" stroke-width="1.1" stroke-dasharray="5,5" stroke-opacity="0.65" />
                    <line x1="0" y1="11.8" x2="40" y2="11.8" stroke="#8B4513" stroke-width="1.1" stroke-dasharray="5,5" stroke-opacity="0.65" />
                    <text x="20" y="14" font-family="Arial" font-size="11" fill="#8B4513" font-weight="bold" stroke="white" stroke-width="0.3" paint-order="stroke" text-anchor="middle">x</text>
                </svg>
                Impassable en véhicules
            </li>
        </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="legend-section">
        <span class="legend-title">Routes principales</span>
        <ul class="roads-paths-list">
            <li class="roads-paths-item"><img src="./legend-images/autobahn.png" alt="Autoroute">Autoroute, Route fédérale / nationale</li>
            <li class="roads-paths-item"><img src="./legend-images/landstrasse.png" alt="Route rurale">Route rurale / départementale</li>

            <li class="roads-paths-item"><img src="./legend-images/normalestrasse.png" alt="Rue locale">Route de district, Rue locale</li>
            <li class="roads-paths-item"><img src="./legend-images/strassenimbau.png" alt="Construction">Route en construction</li>

            <li class="roads-paths-item"><img src="./legend-images/service.png" alt="Voie de service">Voie de service</li>
        </ul>
    </div>

    <hr/>

    <div class="legend-section">
        <span class="legend-title">Zones</span>
        <ul class="legend-list">
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/laubwald.png" alt="Forêt de feuillus">Forêt de feuillus</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/nadelwald.png" alt="Forêt de conifères">Forêt de conifères</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/mischwald.png" alt="Forêt mixte">Forêt mixte</li>

            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/sumpf.png" alt="Marais">Marais</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/moor.png" alt="Tourbière">Tourbière</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/roehricht.png" alt="Roselière">Roselière</li>

            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/watt.png" alt="Estran">Estran / Zone de marée</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/sand.png" alt="Sable">Plage, Sable</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/geroell.png" alt="Éboulis">Éboulis / Pierrier</li>

            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/gehoelz.png" alt="Boisé">Zone boisée</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/wiese.png" alt="Prairie">Prairie</li>
            <li class="legend-item"></li>
            
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/wein.png" alt="Vignoble">Vignoble</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/friedhof.png" alt="Cimetière">Cimetière</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/schrebergarten.png" alt="Jardins familiaux">Jardins familiaux</li>

            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/sperrgebiet.png" alt="Zone restreinte">Zone restreinte / interdite</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/bergbau.png" alt="Mine">Mine, Carrière</li>
        </ul>
    </div>
    
    <hr/>

    <div class="legend-section">
        <span class="legend-title">Lignes</span>
        <ul class="legend-list">
            <li class="legend-item line-and-path-img"><img src="./legend-images/stromleitung.png" alt="Ligne électrique">Ligne électrique</li>
            <li class="legend-item line-and-path-img"><img src="./legend-images/seilbahn.png" alt="Téléphérique">Téléphérique / Remontée</li>
            <li class="legend-item line-and-path-img"></li> 

            <li class="legend-item line-and-path-img"><img src="./legend-images/boeschung.png" alt="Talus">Talus / Remblai</li>
            <li class="legend-item line-and-path-img"><img src="./legend-images/deich.png" alt="Digue">Digue</li>
            <li class="legend-item line-and-path-img"></li> 

            <li class="legend-item line-and-path-img"><img src="./legend-images/zaun.png" alt="Clôture">Clôture</li>
            <li class="legend-item line-and-path-img"><img src="./legend-images/hecke.png" alt="Haie">Haie</li>
        </ul>
    </div>

    <hr/>

    <div class="legend-section">
        <span class="legend-title">Symboles</span>
        <ul class="legend-list">
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/kirche.png" alt="Église">Église</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/kapelle.png" alt="Chapelle">Chapelle</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/burg.png" alt="Château">Château, Forteresse</li>

            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/burgruine.png" alt="Ruine de château">Ruine de château</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/schloss.png" alt="Palais">Palais, Manoir</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/schlossruine.png" alt="Ruine de palais">Ruine de palais</li>

            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/sportplatz.png" alt="Terrain de sport">Terrain de sport</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/stadion.png" alt="Stade">Stade</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/turm.png" alt="Tour">Tour</li>

            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/aussichtsturm.png" alt="Tour d'observation">Tour d'observation</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/wasserturm.png" alt="Château d'eau">Château d'eau</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/sendeturm.png" alt="Tour de transmission">Tour de transmission</li>

            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/mobilfunkmast.png" alt="Antenne mobile">Antenne relais mobile</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/leuchtturm.png" alt="Phare">Phare</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/aussichtspunkt.png" alt="Point de vue">Point de vue</li>

            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/badestelle.png" alt="Zone de baignade">Piscine, Zone de baignade</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/camping.png" alt="Camping">Camping</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/bergwerk.png" alt="Mine">Mine</li>

            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/bergwerk_stillgelegt.png" alt="Mine désaffectée">Mine (désaffectée)</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/muehle.png" alt="Moulin">Moulin</li>

            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/denkmal.png" alt="Monument">Monument, Mémorial</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/wegkreuz.png" alt="Croix de chemin">Croix de chemin</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/huegelgrab.png" alt="Tumulus">Tumulus</li>

            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/gipfel.png" alt="Sommet">Sommet</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/gipfelkreuz.png" alt="Croix de sommet">Croix de sommet</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/quelle.png" alt="Source">Source</li>

            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/hoehle.png" alt="Entrée de grotte">Entrée de grotte</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/kreuz.png" alt="Croix">Croix</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/sattel.png" alt="Col">Col / Selle</li>

            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/laubbaum.png" alt="Arbre remarquable">Arbre remarquable</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/doline.png" alt="Doline">Doline</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/kraftwerk.png" alt="Centrale électrique">Centrale électrique</li>

            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/photovoltaikanlage.png" alt="Système photovoltaïque">Installation photovoltaïque</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/windkraftanlage.png" alt="Éolienne">Éolienne</li>
            <li class="legend-item"><img src="./legend-images/schornstein.png" alt="Cheminée">Cheminée</li>
        </ul>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
